   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Justice and Legal Empowerment project in</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Title: Legal Empowerment and Access to Justice in Zanzibar (LEAP) II. The goal of the overall project is to improve access to justice by eradicating hurdles that hinder access to justice especially for women, girls, and other vulnerable groups. For this additional funding the project places specific emphasis on enhancing access to justice and electoral dispute resolution in Zanzibar by strengthening the capacity of the judiciary and community-based civil society organizations (CSOs), while promoting innovation and sustainability through digital tools and green transport solutions in both Unguja and Pemba.</narrative>
  </description>
